# Local-mode per-cluster summary

**What this is.** When the cohort was run in `global_local` mode,
each (cluster, chrom) carries per-sample tract-level comparisons
between popout's per-site call and the reference tool's
per-site call. We summarise to two numbers per (cluster, chrom):
the mean per-site agreement (fraction of sites where popout and
the reference agree) and the mean tract-level Jaccard index.

